				"to": "00:00:21,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13200,
				"to": 21860
			},
			"text": " Because we'll do another video on radiation where you can get SCR latch-up, which is probably the worst possible condition."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:22,700",
				"to": "00:00:28,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 22700,
				"to": 28920
			},
			"text": " How is it fused? Do you have resettable fuses? How do you deal with latch-up?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,660",
				"to": "00:00:37,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29660,
				"to": 37640
			},
			"text": " Yeah, so for example, with latch-up, for example, there are some pretty nice chips which can actually completely deal with it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,260",
